WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.589 --> 00:00:03.339
(peaceful music)

00:00:09.453 --> 00:00:11.128
- [Woman] Ever since I
can remember I've always

00:00:11.128 --> 00:00:12.728
looked up to you.

00:00:12.728 --> 00:00:15.885
When we were little girls,
I thought you were so cool.

00:00:15.885 --> 00:00:18.840
I did everything I could to
dress and act exactly like you

00:00:18.840 --> 00:00:21.229
because I wanted to be like you.

00:00:21.229 --> 00:00:23.267
Now that I have my own taste in clothes,

00:00:23.267 --> 00:00:25.304
obviously better taste, I want you to know

00:00:25.304 --> 00:00:28.547
I still consider you an
incredible role model.

00:00:28.547 --> 00:00:31.843
You've shown me what being a sister means.

00:00:31.843 --> 00:00:33.944
Being a sister means
bringing chicken noodle soup

00:00:33.944 --> 00:00:36.067
when she feels sick.

00:00:36.067 --> 00:00:38.371
It means fighting over
who gets to ride shotgun

00:00:38.371 --> 00:00:40.871
and sometimes letting her win.

00:00:42.680 --> 00:00:44.483
Being a sister means
listening when she needs

00:00:44.483 --> 00:00:47.800
to vent about something
stupid her friend did.

00:00:47.800 --> 00:00:50.925
Teaching her how to talk to boys

00:00:50.925 --> 00:00:52.856
and teaching her how
to talk shit about boys

00:00:52.856 --> 00:00:55.106
when they break your heart.

00:00:56.813 --> 00:00:59.928
Helping her with schoolwork
you mastered years ago

00:00:59.928 --> 00:01:02.845
and by mastered I mean got a C- on.

00:01:04.301 --> 00:01:07.384
Teaching her how to drive
both when the cops are looking

00:01:07.384 --> 00:01:10.307
and when the cops aren't looking.

00:01:10.307 --> 00:01:12.547
Being a sister means
picking her up from a party

00:01:12.547 --> 00:01:15.297
when she's had too much to drink.

00:01:16.205 --> 00:01:18.541
Being a sister means a
lot of different things

00:01:18.541 --> 00:01:22.708
but most importantly it means
you always have a best friend.

00:01:23.992 --> 00:01:25.880
Thank you for helping me grow from a girl

00:01:25.880 --> 00:01:26.963
into a woman.

00:01:29.187 --> 00:01:30.104
I love you.

00:01:31.469 --> 00:01:34.219
(peaceful music)

